# Private supervisor input, copied outside the repository. No token value here.
COACH_NODE=/absolute/path/to/pinned/node
COACH_WORKER_ENTRYPOINT=/absolute/path/to/repository/host-tools/cli-coach/run-worker.mjs
COACH_WORKER_CONFIG=/absolute/private/worker.json
# Foreground command after the supervisor loads this private environment:
# "$COACH_NODE" "$COACH_WORKER_ENTRYPOINT" "$COACH_WORKER_CONFIG"
# Token, CLI pins, auth home, bounds and backend origin live in private worker.json.
# This example installs or activates no service.
